# Nine-Lives Familiar: "return it ... with one fewer revival counter" (CR 122.6, 603.10a), down to none. Bot2 Bolts the Familiar in each of its turns 2 through 16: it comes back each time with one fewer counter (8 down to 7, ... 1 to 0). The seventh death had one counter on it, so it returns, with none: on turn 17 it is on the battlefield with no revival counter.

